    `Art 13(2) the controller owes the data subject the item of further information` `the personal data relating to the data subject are collected from the data subject` `the item of further information the data subject asks about in Article 13(2)` `the processing is based on point (a) of Article 6(1) or point (a) of Article 9(2)` `there is automated decision-making, including profiling, referred to in Article 22(1) and (4)` `the data subject already has the item of information`

-- 13(3): Art 13(3) the controller provides the data subject, prior to the further processing, with information on the other purpose and any relevant further information
