§§ `Article 14: information where the personal data have not been obtained from the data subject`

-- 14(1): Art 14(1) the controller provides the data subject with the following information
@export Under Article 14(1), as a data subject, where the controller did not obtain my personal data from me, has it provided me with the following information?
GIVEN `the personal data have not been obtained from the data subject` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the personal data have not been obtained from the data subject? Answer true or false.
      `Art 14(5) points (b) to (d) disapply paragraphs 1 to 4` IS A `P2 subject answer` @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that points (b) to (d) disapply paragraphs 1 to 4 (Art 14(5))? Answer P2 subject answer: yes, P2 subject answer: no or P2 subject answer: not sure (not sure is treated as not covered).
      `the controller has a representative` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the controller has a representative? Answer true or false.
      `the controller has designated a data protection officer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the controller has designated a data protection officer? Answer true or false.
      `there are recipients or categories of recipients of the personal data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that there are recipients or categories of recipients of the personal data? Answer true or false.
      `the controller intends to transfer personal data to a recipient in a third country or international organisation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the controller intends to transfer personal data to a recipient in a third country or international organisation? Answer true or false.
      `the information provided includes the identity and the contact details of the controller` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the information provided includes the identity and the contact details of the controller? Answer true or false.
      `the information provided includes the identity and the contact details of the controller's representative` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the information provided includes the identity and the contact details of the controller's representative? Answer true or false.
      `the information provided includes the contact details of the data protection officer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the information provided includes the contact details of the data protection officer? Answer true or false.
      `the information provided includes the purposes of the processing for which the personal data are intended` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the information provided includes the purposes of the processing for which the personal data are intended? Answer true or false.
      `the information provided includes the legal basis for the processing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the information provided includes the legal basis for the processing? Answer true or false.
      `the information provided includes the categories of personal data concerned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the information provided includes the categories of personal data concerned? Answer true or false.
      `the information provided includes the recipients or categories of recipients of the personal data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the information provided includes the recipients or categories of recipients of the personal data? Answer true or false.
      `the information provided includes the intended transfer to a recipient in a third country or international organisation and the adequacy decision or the safeguards` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the information provided includes the intended transfer to a recipient in a third country or international organisation and the adequacy decision or the safeguards? Answer true or false.
      `the data subject already has the information` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the data subject already has the information? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE `Duty outcome`
DECIDE `Under Article 14(1), as a data subject, where the controller did not obtain my personal data from me, has it provided me with the following information` IS
    `Art 14(1) the controller provides the data subject with the following information` `the personal data have not been obtained from the data subject` (`P2 subject answer as a yes or no` `Art 14(5) points (b) to (d) disapply paragraphs 1 to 4`) `the controller has a representative` `the controller has designated a data protection officer` `there are recipients or categories of recipients of the personal data` `the controller intends to transfer personal data to a recipient in a third country or international organisation` (append (IF `the information provided includes the identity and the contact details of the controller` THEN LIST `Art 14(1)(a) the identity and the contact details of the controller` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the information provided includes the identity and the contact details of the controller's representative` THEN LIST `Art 14(1)(a) the identity and the contact details of the controller's representative` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the information provided includes the contact details of the data protection officer` THEN LIST `Art 14(1)(b) the contact details of the data protection officer` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the information provided includes the purposes of the processing for which the personal data are intended` THEN LIST `Art 14(1)(c) the purposes of the processing for which the personal data are intended` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the information provided includes the legal basis for the processing` THEN LIST `Art 14(1)(c) the legal basis for the processing` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the information provided includes the categories of personal data concerned` THEN LIST `Art 14(1)(d) the categories of personal data concerned` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the information provided includes the recipients or categories of recipients of the personal data` THEN LIST `Art 14(1)(e) the recipients or categories of recipients of the personal data` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the information provided includes the intended transfer to a recipient in a third country or international organisation and the adequacy decision or the safeguards` THEN LIST `Art 14(1)(f) the intended transfer to a recipient in a third country or international organisation and the adequacy decision or the safeguards` ELSE EMPTY) EMPTY)))))))) (IF `the data subject already has the information` THEN (LIST `Art 14(1)(a) the identity and the contact details of the controller`, `Art 14(1)(a) the identity and the contact details of the controller's representative`, `Art 14(1)(b) the contact details of the data protection officer`, `Art 14(1)(c) the purposes of the processing for which the personal data are intended`, `Art 14(1)(c) the legal basis for the processing`, `Art 14(1)(d) the categories of personal data concerned`, `Art 14(1)(e) the recipients or categories of recipients of the personal data`, `Art 14(1)(f) the intended transfer to a recipient in a third country or international organisation and the adequacy decision or the safeguards`) ELSE EMPTY)

