    `Art 14(5) points (b) to (d) disapply paragraphs 1 to 4` (`P2 subject answer as a yes or no` `Art 14(5)(b) paragraphs 1 to 4 do not apply where and insofar as the provision of the information proves impossible or would involve a disproportionate effort`) (`P2 subject answer as a yes or no` `Art 14(5)(c) paragraphs 1 to 4 do not apply where and insofar as obtaining or disclosure is expressly laid down by Union or Member State law`) (`P2 subject answer as a yes or no` `Art 14(5)(d) paragraphs 1 to 4 do not apply where the personal data must remain confidential subject to an obligation of professional secrecy`)


§§ `Article 15: right of access by the data subject`

-- 15(1)a: Art 15(1) the data subject has the right to obtain from the controller confirmation as to whether or not personal data concerning him or her are being processed
@export Under Article 15(1), as a data subject, am I entitled to obtain from the controller confirmation as to whether or not personal data concerning me are being processed?
GIVEN `the body is the controller` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the body is the controller? Answer true or false.
      `the request concerns a case referred to in Article 11(2): the controller is not in a position to identify the data subject` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the request concerns a case referred to in Article 11(2): the controller is not in a position to identify the data subject? Answer true or false.
      `the data subject has provided information enabling the controller to identify him or her` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the data subject has provided information enabling the controller to identify him or her? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 15(1), as a data subject, am I entitled to obtain from the controller confirmation as to whether or not personal data concerning me are being processed` IS
    `Art 15(1) the data subject has the right to obtain from the controller confirmation as to whether or not personal data concerning him or her are being processed` TRUE `the body is the controller` (`P2 subject Art 11(2) answer from the facts` `the request concerns a case referred to in Article 11(2): the controller is not in a position to identify the data subject` `the data subject has provided information enabling the controller to identify him or her`)

-- 15(1)b: Art 15(1) the data subject has the right to obtain from the controller access to the personal data
@export Under Article 15(1), as a data subject, am I entitled to obtain from the controller access to the personal data concerning me?
GIVEN `the body is the controller` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the body is the controller? Answer true or false.
      `personal data concerning the data subject are being processed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that personal data concerning the data subject are being processed? Answer true or false.
      `the request concerns a case referred to in Article 11(2): the controller is not in a position to identify the data subject` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the request concerns a case referred to in Article 11(2): the controller is not in a position to identify the data subject? Answer true or false.
      `the data subject has provided information enabling the controller to identify him or her` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the data subject has provided information enabling the controller to identify him or her? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 15(1), as a data subject, am I entitled to obtain from the controller access to the personal data concerning me` IS
    `Art 15(1) the data subject has the right to obtain from the controller access to the personal data` TRUE `the body is the controller` `personal data concerning the data subject are being processed` (`P2 subject Art 11(2) answer from the facts` `the request concerns a case referred to in Article 11(2): the controller is not in a position to identify the data subject` `the data subject has provided information enabling the controller to identify him or her`)

-- 15(1)c: Art 15(1) the data subject has the right to obtain from the controller the following information
@export Under Article 15(1), as a data subject, am I entitled to obtain from the controller the item of information I name?
GIVEN `the body is the controller` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the body is the controller? Answer true or false.
      `personal data concerning the data subject are being processed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that personal data concerning the data subject are being processed? Answer true or false.
      `the item of information the data subject asks about` IS A `Art 15(1) item of information` @desc The item of information the data subject asks about: choose exactly one of: Art 15(1)(a) the purposes of the processing; Art 15(1)(b) the categories of personal data concerned; Art 15(1)(c) the recipients or categories of recipient to whom the personal data have been or will be disclosed; Art 15(1)(d) the envisaged period for which the personal data will be stored, or the criteria used to determine that period; Art 15(1)(e) the existence of the right to request rectification or erasure of personal data or restriction of processing, or to object to such processing; Art 15(1)(f) the right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority; Art 15(1)(g) any available information as to the source of the personal data; Art 15(1)(h) the existence of automated decision-making, including profiling, and meaningful information about the logic involved, the significance and the envisaged consequences.
      `the personal data are not collected from the data subject` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the personal data are not collected from the data subject? Answer true or false.
      `there is automated decision-making, including profiling, referred to in Article 22(1) and (4)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that there is automated decision-making, including profiling, referred to in Article 22(1) and (4)? Answer true or false.
      `the request concerns a case referred to in Article 11(2): the controller is not in a position to identify the data subject` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the request concerns a case referred to in Article 11(2): the controller is not in a position to identify the data subject? Answer true or false.
      `the data subject has provided information enabling the controller to identify him or her` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the data subject has provided information enabling the controller to identify him or her? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 15(1), as a data subject, am I entitled to obtain from the controller the item of information I name` IS
    `Art 15(1) the data subject has the right to obtain from the controller the following information` TRUE `the body is the controller` `personal data concerning the data subject are being processed` `the item of information the data subject asks about` `the personal data are not collected from the data subject` `there is automated decision-making, including profiling, referred to in Article 22(1) and (4)` (`P2 subject Art 11(2) answer from the facts` `the request concerns a case referred to in Article 11(2): the controller is not in a position to identify the data subject` `the data subject has provided information enabling the controller to identify him or her`)

-- 15(2): Art 15(2) the data subject has the right to be informed of the appropriate safeguards pursuant to Article 46 relating to the transfer
