      `the personal data have been disclosed to the body` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the personal data have been disclosed to the body? Answer true or false.
      `the body is a third party` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the body is a third party? Answer true or false.
      `the personal data are received in the framework of a particular inquiry` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the personal data are received in the framework of a particular inquiry? Answer true or false.
      `the receipt is in accordance with Union or Member State law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the receipt is in accordance with Union or Member State law? Answer true or false.
      `communicating it proves impossible or involves disproportionate effort` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that communicating it proves impossible or involves disproportionate effort? Answer true or false.
      `the controller has communicated it to the body` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the controller has communicated it to the body? Answer true or false.
      `the request concerns a case referred to in Article 11(2): the controller is not in a position to identify the data subject` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the request concerns a case referred to in Article 11(2): the controller is not in a position to identify the data subject? Answer true or false.
      `the data subject has provided information enabling the controller to identify him or her` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the data subject has provided information enabling the controller to identify him or her? Answer true or false.
