      `the controller has implemented suitable measures to safeguard the data subject's rights and freedoms and legitimate interests` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the controller has implemented suitable measures to safeguard the data subject's rights and freedoms and legitimate interests? Answer true or false.
