      `the restriction is by way of a legislative measure` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the restriction is by way of a legislative measure? Answer true or false.
      `the provision whose scope the law restricts` IS A `Art 23(1) provision whose scope is restricted` @desc The provision whose scope the law restricts: choose exactly one of: Art 23(1) an obligation or a right provided for in Articles 12 to 22; Art 23(1) an obligation provided for in Article 34; Art 23(1) Article 5, in so far as its provisions correspond to the rights and obligations provided for in Articles 12 to 22; Art 23(1) some other provision of the Regulation.
      `the objective the restriction safeguards` IS A `Art 23(1) objective safeguarded` @desc The objective the restriction safeguards: choose exactly one of: Art 23(1)(a) national security; Art 23(1)(b) defence; Art 23(1)(c) public security; Art 23(1)(d) the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences or the execution of criminal penalties, including the safeguarding against and the prevention of threats to public security; Art 23(1)(e) other important objectives of general public interest of the Union or of a Member State, in particular an important economic or financial interest, including monetary, budgetary and taxation matters, public health and social security; Art 23(1)(f) the protection of judicial independence and judicial proceedings; Art 23(1)(g) the prevention, investigation, detection and prosecution of breaches of ethics for regulated professions; Art 23(1)(h) a monitoring, inspection or regulatory function connected, even occasionally, to the exercise of official authority in the cases referred to in points (a) to (e) and (g); Art 23(1)(i) the protection of the data subject or the rights and freedoms of others; Art 23(1)(j) the enforcement of civil law claims; Art 23(1) some other objective.
      `the function is connected, even occasionally, to the exercise of official authority in the cases referred to in points (a) to (e) and (g)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the function is connected, even occasionally, to the exercise of official authority in the cases referred to in points (a) to (e) and (g)? Answer true or false.
      `the restriction respects the essence of the fundamental rights and freedoms` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the restriction respects the essence of the fundamental rights and freedoms? Answer true or false.
      `the restriction is a necessary and proportionate measure in a democratic society` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the restriction is a necessary and proportionate measure in a democratic society? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 23(1), as a data subject, may Union or Member State law restrict by a legislative measure the scope of the rights I have under Articles 12 to 22` IS
    `Art 23(1) Union or Member State law may restrict by way of a legislative measure the scope of the obligations and rights` `the law is Union law or Member State law to which the controller or processor is subject` `the restriction is by way of a legislative measure` `the provision whose scope the law restricts` `the objective the restriction safeguards` `the function is connected, even occasionally, to the exercise of official authority in the cases referred to in points (a) to (e) and (g)` `the restriction respects the essence of the fundamental rights and freedoms` `the restriction is a necessary and proportionate measure in a democratic society`

-- 23(1)b: Art 23(1) the law is a necessary and proportionate measure in a democratic society to safeguard one of the objectives referred to in Article 23(1)
@export Under Article 23(1), as a data subject, is the law that restricts my rights a necessary and proportionate measure in a democratic society to safeguard one of the objectives that paragraph 1 names?
GIVEN `the objective the restriction safeguards` IS A `Art 23(1) objective safeguarded` @desc The objective the restriction safeguards: choose exactly one of: Art 23(1)(a) national security; Art 23(1)(b) defence; Art 23(1)(c) public security; Art 23(1)(d) the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences or the execution of criminal penalties, including the safeguarding against and the prevention of threats to public security; Art 23(1)(e) other important objectives of general public interest of the Union or of a Member State, in particular an important economic or financial interest, including monetary, budgetary and taxation matters, public health and social security; Art 23(1)(f) the protection of judicial independence and judicial proceedings; Art 23(1)(g) the prevention, investigation, detection and prosecution of breaches of ethics for regulated professions; Art 23(1)(h) a monitoring, inspection or regulatory function connected, even occasionally, to the exercise of official authority in the cases referred to in points (a) to (e) and (g); Art 23(1)(i) the protection of the data subject or the rights and freedoms of others; Art 23(1)(j) the enforcement of civil law claims; Art 23(1) some other objective.
      `the law constitutes a necessary and proportionate measure in a democratic society` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the law constitutes a necessary and proportionate measure in a democratic society? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 23(1), as a data subject, is the law that restricts my rights a necessary and proportionate measure in a democratic society to safeguard one of the objectives that paragraph 1 names` IS
    `Art 23(1) the law is a necessary and proportionate measure in a democratic society to safeguard one of the objectives referred to in Article 23(1)` `the objective the restriction safeguards` `the law constitutes a necessary and proportionate measure in a democratic society`

-- 23(2): Art 23(2) the legislative measure contains specific provisions at least, where relevant, as to the matters that paragraph 2 lists
@export Under Article 23(2), as a data subject, does the legislative measure that restricts my rights contain specific provisions at least, where relevant, as to the matters that paragraph 2 lists?
GIVEN `the matter of the purposes of the processing or categories of processing is relevant to the restriction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the matter of the purposes of the processing or categories of processing is relevant to the restriction? Answer true or false.
      `the matter of the categories of personal data is relevant to the restriction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the matter of the categories of personal data is relevant to the restriction? Answer true or false.
      `the matter of the scope of the restrictions introduced is relevant to the restriction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the matter of the scope of the restrictions introduced is relevant to the restriction? Answer true or false.
      `the matter of the safeguards to prevent abuse or unlawful access or transfer is relevant to the restriction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the matter of the safeguards to prevent abuse or unlawful access or transfer is relevant to the restriction? Answer true or false.
      `the matter of the specification of the controller or categories of controllers is relevant to the restriction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the matter of the specification of the controller or categories of controllers is relevant to the restriction? Answer true or false.
      `the matter of the storage periods and the applicable safeguards taking into account the nature, scope and purposes of the processing or categories of processing is relevant to the restriction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the matter of the storage periods and the applicable safeguards taking into account the nature, scope and purposes of the processing or categories of processing is relevant to the restriction? Answer true or false.
      `the matter of the risks to the rights and freedoms of data subjects is relevant to the restriction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the matter of the risks to the rights and freedoms of data subjects is relevant to the restriction? Answer true or false.
      `the matter of the right of data subjects to be informed about the restriction is relevant to the restriction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the matter of the right of data subjects to be informed about the restriction is relevant to the restriction? Answer true or false.
      `the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the purposes of the processing or categories of processing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the purposes of the processing or categories of processing? Answer true or false.
      `the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the categories of personal data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the categories of personal data? Answer true or false.
      `the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the scope of the restrictions introduced` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the scope of the restrictions introduced? Answer true or false.
      `the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the safeguards to prevent abuse or unlawful access or transfer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the safeguards to prevent abuse or unlawful access or transfer? Answer true or false.
      `the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the specification of the controller or categories of controllers` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the specification of the controller or categories of controllers? Answer true or false.
      `the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the storage periods and the applicable safeguards taking into account the nature, scope and purposes of the processing or categories of processing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the storage periods and the applicable safeguards taking into account the nature, scope and purposes of the processing or categories of processing? Answer true or false.
      `the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the risks to the rights and freedoms of data subjects` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the risks to the rights and freedoms of data subjects? Answer true or false.
      `the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the right of data subjects to be informed about the restriction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the right of data subjects to be informed about the restriction? Answer true or false.
      `informing the data subjects about the restriction may be prejudicial to the purpose of the restriction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc As far as you can tell, is it the case that informing the data subjects about the restriction may be prejudicial to the purpose of the restriction? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 23(2), as a data subject, does the legislative measure that restricts my rights contain specific provisions at least, where relevant, as to the matters that paragraph 2 lists` IS
    `Art 23(2) the legislative measure contains specific provisions at least, where relevant, as to the matters that paragraph 2 lists` (append (IF `the matter of the purposes of the processing or categories of processing is relevant to the restriction` THEN LIST `Art 23(2)(a) the purposes of the processing or categories of processing` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the matter of the categories of personal data is relevant to the restriction` THEN LIST `Art 23(2)(b) the categories of personal data` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the matter of the scope of the restrictions introduced is relevant to the restriction` THEN LIST `Art 23(2)(c) the scope of the restrictions introduced` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the matter of the safeguards to prevent abuse or unlawful access or transfer is relevant to the restriction` THEN LIST `Art 23(2)(d) the safeguards to prevent abuse or unlawful access or transfer` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the matter of the specification of the controller or categories of controllers is relevant to the restriction` THEN LIST `Art 23(2)(e) the specification of the controller or categories of controllers` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the matter of the storage periods and the applicable safeguards taking into account the nature, scope and purposes of the processing or categories of processing is relevant to the restriction` THEN LIST `Art 23(2)(f) the storage periods and the applicable safeguards taking into account the nature, scope and purposes of the processing or categories of processing` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the matter of the risks to the rights and freedoms of data subjects is relevant to the restriction` THEN LIST `Art 23(2)(g) the risks to the rights and freedoms of data subjects` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the matter of the right of data subjects to be informed about the restriction is relevant to the restriction` THEN LIST `Art 23(2)(h) the right of data subjects to be informed about the restriction` ELSE EMPTY) EMPTY)))))))) (append (IF `the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the purposes of the processing or categories of processing` THEN LIST `Art 23(2)(a) the purposes of the processing or categories of processing` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the categories of personal data` THEN LIST `Art 23(2)(b) the categories of personal data` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the scope of the restrictions introduced` THEN LIST `Art 23(2)(c) the scope of the restrictions introduced` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the safeguards to prevent abuse or unlawful access or transfer` THEN LIST `Art 23(2)(d) the safeguards to prevent abuse or unlawful access or transfer` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the specification of the controller or categories of controllers` THEN LIST `Art 23(2)(e) the specification of the controller or categories of controllers` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the storage periods and the applicable safeguards taking into account the nature, scope and purposes of the processing or categories of processing` THEN LIST `Art 23(2)(f) the storage periods and the applicable safeguards taking into account the nature, scope and purposes of the processing or categories of processing` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the risks to the rights and freedoms of data subjects` THEN LIST `Art 23(2)(g) the risks to the rights and freedoms of data subjects` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `the legislative measure contains a specific provision as to the right of data subjects to be informed about the restriction` THEN LIST `Art 23(2)(h) the right of data subjects to be informed about the restriction` ELSE EMPTY) EMPTY)))))))) `informing the data subjects about the restriction may be prejudicial to the purpose of the restriction`
